            "title": "Does the S1 Pro need a window or exhaust hose?",
            "content": "<p>No. The S1 Pro is a ductless portable air conditioner, so it does not need a window kit, exhaust hose or permanent installation. Place it in the room and start cooling.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do I need to drain the water tank?",
            "content": "<p>In humid conditions the unit collects condensation. When the tank is full, the display will alert you. Switch the unit off, remove the tank and empty it, then reinstall it before use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What size room is it designed for?",
            "content": "<p>Cooling performance depends on room size, insulation, sun exposure and the number of occupants. Please refer to the specifications on the product page and the Amazon US listing for the recommended room size.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How do I set it up?",
            "content": "<p>Unpack the unit, install the water tank, plug it in and use the touchscreen to select a mode. No tools or window installation are required.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Where can I buy the S1 Pro and get after-sales support?",
            "content": "<p>The S1 Pro is available on Amazon US. For order, delivery, warranty and return questions, please use the Amazon customer service channel. You can also contact our support team from the Contact page.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
